@localUrl = http://localhost:3000
@renderUrl = https://cse341-web-services-stcf.onrender.com

# After each POST, paste the returned ID into the matching variable.
# The previous local test contact was deleted, so create a new one.
@localContactId = 6abd52680bcbb22443eff05a
@renderContactId = 6abd52680bcbb22443eff05a

### LOCAL: Get all contacts — expect 200
GET {{localUrl}}/contacts
Accept: application/json


### LOCAL: Create a test contact — expect 201 and a new ID
POST {{localUrl}}/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Test",
    "lastName": "Contact",
    "email": "test.contact@example.com",
    "favoriteColor": "Blue",
    "birthday": "2000-01-15"
}


### LOCAL: Get the test contact — expect 200
GET {{localUrl}}/contacts/single?id={{localContactId}}
Accept: application/json


### LOCAL: Update the test contact — expect 204
PUT {{localUrl}}/contacts/{{localContactId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Test",
    "lastName": "Contact",
    "email": "test.contact@example.com",
    "favoriteColor": "Green",
    "birthday": "2000-01-15"
}


### LOCAL: Verify the update — expect 200 and Green
GET {{localUrl}}/contacts/single?id={{localContactId}}
Accept: application/json


### LOCAL: Test missing required fields — expect 400
POST {{localUrl}}/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Incomplete"
}


### LOCAL: Delete the test contact — expect 200
DELETE {{localUrl}}/contacts/{{localContactId}}


### LOCAL: Verify deletion — expect 404
GET {{localUrl}}/contacts/single?id={{localContactId}}
Accept: application/json


